  eventID: FacilityDuoInitial
  dialogueLines:
  - "This man is talking to another employee. I wonder what they\u2019re discussing."
  - "These two seem to be having a pretty involved conversation. Wonder what it\u2019s
    about."
  - "This guy appears to be catching up with a coworker. Curious what they\u2019re
    talking about."
  - "The two workers are deep in conversation. The narrator wonders what\u2019s being
    discussed."
  - This man is having a chat with one of his coworkers. It seems rather important.
  - "These two are talking about something. The narrator is curious, but probably
    shouldn\u2019t interrupt."
  - "This guy seems to have found someone to talk to. Wonder what they\u2019re discussing."
  - The workers appear to be discussing something together. Perhaps the player can
    figure it out.
  - This man is busy talking with another worker. The narrator wonders what could
    be so interesting.
  - "These two look like they\u2019re in the middle of a conversation. Whatever it
    is, they seem rather focused on it."
